@@ -23,16 +24,30 @@
 Template syntax: {{VAR}} substitutes; {{#FLAG}}…{{/FLAG}} keeps the block when
 FLAG is true, {{^FLAG}}…{{/FLAG}} when it is false. A tag alone on its line
 takes the line with it. "__APP__" in paths becomes APP.
+
+--templates DIR renders another template tree instead of the built-in one.
+Any extra keys in app.json (AU_SUBTYPE, APP_C, ...) are then available as
+{{VARS}} (config keys always are), and FILE_FLAGS, which name built-in paths,
+are not applied. Binary files (.png .jpg .car .icns, or anything that is not
+UTF-8) are copied unchanged, in both modes. What a build or a tool left at the
+top of DIR is not part of the template and is skipped: .build, build, .swiftpm
+and .git (SKIPPED_TOP).
 """
